The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.

Short description
-----------------

linear_elastic1

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Stretching a bar.
 Standard displacement formulation. 2D, plane strain or plane stress.

linear_elastic2

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Stretching a bar.
 Mixed displacement-pressure formulation. 2D, plane strain or plane stress.

linear_elastic3

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Stretching a bar.
 Standard displacement formulation. Axisymmetric.

linear_elastic4

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Stretching a bar.
 Mixed displacement-pressure formulation. Axisymmetric.

linear_elastic5

 Linear elastic problem on a 3D rectangular box. Stretching a bar.
 Standard displacement formulation.

linear_elastic6

 Linear elastic problem on a 3D rectangular box. Stretching a bar.
 Mixed displacement-pressure formulation.

linear_elastic7

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Stretching and rotating a bar.
 Standard displacement formulation. Axisymmetric with torsion.

linear_elastic8

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Stretching and rotating a bar.
 Mixed displacement-pressure formulation. Axisymmetric with torsion.

linear_elastic9

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Stretching a bar.
 Standard displacement formulation. 2D, plane strain or plane stress.
 Bilinear Q1 elements for the displacement.

linear_elastic10

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Stretching a bar.
 Standard displacement formulation. 2D, plane strain or plane stress.
 Stabilized mixed element example: Q1/Q1 displacement/pressure

linear_elastic11

 Linear elastic problem on a domain two cylinders having a jump in radius.
 Stretching and rotating.
 Standard displacement formulation. Axisymmetric with torsion.

linear_elastic12

 Linear elastic problem on a square. Manufactured solution.
 Standard displacement formulation. 2D, plane strain or plane stress.

linear_elastic13

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Manufactured solution.
 Mixed displacement-pressure formulation. 2D, plane strain or plane stress.

linear_elastic14

 Linear elastic problem on a square. Manufactured solution.
 Standard displacement formulation. Axisymmetric.

linear_elastic15

 Linear elastic problem on a square. Manufactured solution.
 Mixed displacement-pressure formulation. Axisymmetric.

linear_elastic16

 Linear elastic problem on a 3D cube. Manufactured solution.
 Standard displacement formulation.

linear_elastic17

 Linear elastic problem on a 3D cube. Manufactured solution.
 Mixed displacement-pressure formulation.

linear_elastic18

 Linear elastic problem on a square. Manufactured solution.
 Standard displacement formulation. Axisymmetric with torsion.

linear_elastic19

 Linear elastic problem on a square. Manufactured solution.
 Mixed displacement-pressure formulation. Axisymmetric with torsion.

linear_elastic20

 Linear elastic problem on a square with a hole. Stretching in x-direction
 Standard displacement formulation. 2D, plane strain or plane stress.

linear_elastic21

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Stretching a bar. Thermal expansion.
 Standard displacement formulation. 2D, plane strain or plane stress.

linear_elastic22

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Stretching a bar. Thermal expansion.
 Mixed displacement-pressure formulation. 2D, plane strain or plane stress.

linear_elastic23

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Stretching a bar. Thermal expansion.
 Standard displacement formulation. Axisymmetric.

linear_elastic24

 Linear elastic problem on a rectangle. Stretching a bar. Thermal expansion.
 Mixed displacement-pressure formulation. Axisymmetric.

linear_elastic25

 Linear elastic problem on a 3D rectangular box. Stretching a bar.
 Thermal expansion.
 Standard displacement formulation.

linear_elastic26

 Linear elastic problem on a 3D rectangular box. Stretching a bar.
 Thermal expansion.
 Mixed displacement-pressure formulation.

linear_elastic27

 Linear elastic problem on a 3D rectangular box. Stretching a bar.
 Thermal expansion. Side pressure.
 Example 3.8 of Fenner & Reddy (for uniform=.true.)
 Standard displacement formulation.

